---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { legal } from '../data/legal';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy · Samuel Castillo Glantz" description="How samuelcglantz.com handles your data.">
  <article class="prose-cartridge max-w-[65ch] pt-14 text-lg">
    <h1 class="font-display glow-cyan text-xl">Privacy</h1>
    <p>This is a personal portfolio. It has no accounts, no forms and no cookies.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted by Vercel Inc. When you visit a page, Vercel processes technical data such as your IP address, browser
      type and the time of the request in its server logs, in order to deliver the site and keep it secure (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).
    </p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      I use Vercel Web Analytics to count page views. It sets no cookies and doesn't track you across sites. Visits are only
      counted in aggregate.
    </p>
    <h2>Your settings</h2>
    <p>
      The sound and effects switches remember your choice in your browser's local storage. That data never leaves your
      device.
    </p>
    <h2>Fonts and media</h2>
    <p>All fonts, images and videos are served from this domain. No third-party services are contacted.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to access, correct and delete your data, and to complain to a data protection authority. Contact:
      <a href={`mailto:${legal.email}`}>{legal.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
